  "alt": {
    "en": "Cancellation and receipt commit together in the local database. A lost reply leaves the caller uncertain. Recovery reads the receipt; replay only displays events.",
    "zh-hans": "本地数据库同时提交取消与回执。响应丢失使调用方无法确定结果；恢复时读取回执，回放则只展示事件。"
  },
